WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,313
Brother Mo

2
00:00:02,313 --> 00:00:08,800
You are finally back

3
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:14,140
If you don’t come back, I’m planning to go to Xiaoliangshan to find you.

4
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,410
I've been back for a few days, but I didn't come to school

5
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,330
How has your training been this month?

6
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:24,460
Just yesterday, my iron-clawed bear gave birth to the fourth child. Is that okay?

7
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,580
I still want to thank you for buying me Shouliang

8
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:27,700
Otherwise it wouldn't be so fast

9
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,040
My brother, you are so polite.

10
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,060
Can I ask, what is the current level of your pet life?

11
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:39,420
Brother Mo, Jinfeng Lake in Fucheng City has also grown into four sections.

12
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,060
More than ten days earlier than me

13
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:42,950
There's nothing I can't ask

14
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:45,470
My beloved is now in the sixth stage of his life

15
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:48,270
Sixth stage is born again, we are still struggling in the third stage

16
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:50,590
Is he actually already six-dan six?

17
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,220
I thought the gap could be narrowed

18
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:55,250
I didn’t expect it to get bigger and bigger.
